        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robin Pingeton, Cindy Stein\n- Organizations: University of Missouri, Southern Illinois University Carbondale, Southeastern Conference\n- Teams: Missouri Tigers women's basketball team\n- Places: Mizzou Arena\n- Roles: Head women's basketball coach\n\nFacts:\n- Robin Pingeton was born on July 9, 1968.\n- Cindy Stein was born on January 22, 1961.\n- Robin Pingeton was hired in April 2010 as head coach of the University of Missouri women's basketball team, replacing former head coach Cindy Stein.\n- Cindy Stein is the current head women's basketball coach at Southern Illinois University Carbondale.\n- In the 2014–15 season, Robin Pingeton was in her fifth year as head coach of the Missouri Tigers women's basketball team.\n- In the 2014–15 season, the Missouri Tigers women's basketball team played its home games at Mizzou Arena and was a member of the Southeastern Conference.",
